UnrealFolder/ProjectMobius/Content/01_Dev/RuntimeMeshGenerator/RuntimeDatasmithOverrides/*

UnrealFolder/ProjectMobius 5.4/Content/Crowd/*
UnrealFolder/ProjectMobius 5.4/Content/Character/*
UnrealFolder/ProjectMobius 5.4/Content/StarterContent/*
UnrealFolder/ProjectMobius 5.4/Content/01_Dev/Data/PedestrianMeshes/ImportedUECrowd/Materials/Clothing/Textures/leather/leather-sjqecg1c_Normal_VT.uasset

UnrealFolder/ProjectMobius 5.5/Content/Crowd/*
UnrealFolder/ProjectMobius 5.5/Content/Character/*
